pe":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/26/1861035/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ絶対に秘密だよ？？え"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあとにもかくにも作品の完成楽しみーに待っててね(*^^*)ね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまってしまった質問返しスタート！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.ずっと愛未単推しで良いかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.あーもーお願いします！！！(＞人＜;)あみだけよ？？絶対よぉっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.あみちゃんは大学進学するんですか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.考え中なうでございます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.あと自分は体育祭をこないだしましたがあみちゃんはしましたか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.もちろんあみも体育祭したよぉ(^_-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ楽しかったんだから！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.好きなスポーツでバスケは好きですか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.バスケすきよぉっ！超下手くそだけども(＞人＜;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.あみあみはかき氷は何味が好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.ブルーハワイでしょ！舌が青くなっちゃうの好き"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/26/1861035/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.名古屋名物の、手羽先さま、美味しかったですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.おいしかったぁーー！！何個食べたっけ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.どんなダイエットをしたの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.6時いこう絶対食べない！顔と足マッサージ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.あみあみがボケたら主に誰がツッコんで来る？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.誰だろ......みんなあみがボケるのを見て笑ってるか見守ってるかどっちかだからなあー(*^^*)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.夢って、歌手？女優？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.女優です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.今さらだけどあみあみ族入ってもいい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.あみあみ族はいつでも入れるシステムなんだよ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.手羽先の正式な食べ方はらりんから教わったかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.うん！永島せいらに教わったーー(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.愛未は休みの日とか一人でいる時はどう過ごしてるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.寝てるか寝てるかどっちかかな？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.最近どう？パスタ巻いてる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.巻いてる巻いてるぅ！って、面白い質問だね。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.お手紙届いてますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.届いてるよ！ありがとうよぉー（＾＿＾）☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.金属アレルギーとかあったりする？大丈夫？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.ママはあるけどあみはないよん(^_-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.3rdのレッスンがんばってますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.絶賛レッスン中ですよー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみに待ってて？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.元気になった？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.乃木ここのボーリング大会観た？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"超元気よ！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.りなの顔おぼえてる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.あみのことバカにするなよー(o^^o)覚えてるよ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.まだあみあみに会えてないからあみあみ族には入れないかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.会えてなくても心があみを応援してればそれは自動的にあみあみ族なのだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.まだ幕張の個別握手から1週間なのにあみ不足が激しいんだけどどうしたら良い？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.それは次のイベントに必ず来るべきだっ！！待ってるぞい(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.あみあみは好きな人とゴハン食べに行くとしたら何を食べに行きたいですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.焼肉！！それか美味しいパスタ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.あみあみから見て、この子面白いって思うメンバーって誰？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.んーみんな面白いんだよなぁー笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっちゃんとか結構ツボが合う！あと七瀬もツボが合う！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.今度握手しに言ったら、優しくしてくれますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.うん。優しさで包み込んであげる！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.全然痩せれないんだけどあみあみどうやってんの？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.痩せるのって本当大変。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみはとにかく根気よくマッサージとか6時いこう食べない！とか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.男は黒髪派？茶髪派？金髪派？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.なんでも似合ってる事が一番！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんのり茶色とか好きだけど、似合ってれば金髪でも黒髪でもなんでもオッケー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.そういえば鳥を飼うかどうか迷ってるって言ってたけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それはどうなった？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.うん！飼うよ？でもまだなんだなぁー笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.小腹が空いたのでコンビニに入りました。あみあみは何を買いますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.メロンパン！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.あみは俺が1大好き2好き3普通4嫌い5大嫌い何番?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.あみを応援してくれる人はみんな大好き！だから１(^_-)"},{"type":"break